    {
      "id": 39197,
      "name": "arenson9",
      "username": "arenson9",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-25T23:41:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"awp832\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> awp832:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;Just curious, as to why this team?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It's a wonderful combination of power, support, and slow build</p>\n<p>Ra and Young Legacy &nbsp;are up-front damage w/ Tempest doing AoE. Ra and Young Legacy also both have potential to give plus one to everyone. Unity is just awesome all by herself, and when she's with a lot of other immediate damage heroes who ALSO have a ways to affect the ongoing and decks she gets the time she needs to get a bunch of bots out and then it's game over. And Argent Adept? The ultimate swiss army knife.&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:12:56.161Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
